### End-to-end accuracy

Controlled setup:

- Kimi-K3 target and Kimi-K3-DSpark draft model, TP8 on two GB300 nodes;
- seven greedy draft tokens and block rejection sampling;
- align-mode Mamba cache, prefix caching, FP8 MLA cache, FlashInfer MLA, and fastsafetensors;
- identical datasets, prompts, scorers, and serving parameters for RecoverSSM ON and OFF.

| GSM8K, 1,319 samples | RecoverSSM ON |      OFF |   ON - OFF |
| -------------------- | ------------: | -------: | ---------: |
| Flexible extract     |      96.3609% | 96.1334% | +0.2274 pp |
| Strict match         |      96.0576% | 95.9060% | +0.1516 pp |

The paired 95% confidence intervals were `[-0.4549, +0.9098]` pp for flexible extract and `[-0.6065, +0.9098]` pp for strict match. Both runs completed all 1,319 requests with zero request errors. Independently initialized greedy serving runs are not bitwise deterministic, so the paired score comparison is used instead of exact generated-text equality.
